§§ `ss 31 to 34B, 104 to 109 -- maximum penalties`

#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `IM` `company` EQUALS `a fine of up to, in penalty units` 65000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `IM` `business or officer` EQUALS `imprisonment for life`
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `IM` `other individual` EQUALS `none: only a business or undertaking, or its officer, can commit industrial manslaughter (s 34B(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 1` `company` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 3000000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 1` `business or officer` EQUALS `a fine of up to, or imprisonment for up to, or both` 600000 5
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 1` `other individual` EQUALS `a fine of up to, or imprisonment for up to, or both` 300000 5
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 2` `other individual` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 150000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 2` `business or officer` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 300000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 2` `company` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 1500000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 3` `other individual` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 50000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 3` `business or officer` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 100000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Cat 3` `company` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 500000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Part 6 offence` `business or officer` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 100000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Part 6 offence` `other individual` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 100000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `Part 6 offence` `company` EQUALS `a fine of up to` 500000
#ASSERT `the most an offender can get` `another offence against the Act` `company` EQUALS `not answered here`

