#ASSERT (`s 231 -- between which days may I ask` (`the calendar date` 15 1 2026))'s `the first day` EQUALS `the calendar date` 16 7 2026
#ASSERT (`s 231 -- between which days may I ask` (`the calendar date` 15 1 2026))'s `the last day` EQUALS `the calendar date` 15 1 2027
